{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-62289",
    "CVE-2026-62291"
  ],
  "description": "Feng Ning discovered that libheif incorrectly handled certain image\ntransforms. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a\ndenial of service. This issue only affected Ubuntu 18.04 LTS, Ubuntu\n20.04 LTS, and Ubuntu 22.04 LTS. (CVE-2026-62289)\n\nAli Firas discovered that libheif incorrectly handled certain images. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service or\nexecute arbitrary code. This issue only affected Ubuntu 24.04 LTS.\n(CVE-2026-62291)",
  "id": "USN-8683-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in libheif.",
